<h1>feedback vertex set</h1>
<p>
(definition)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
The smallest <a href="set.html"><em>set</em></a> of <a href="vertex.html"><em>vertices</em></a> whose deletion results in an <a href="acyclicgraph.html"><em>acyclic graph</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="feedbackEdgeSet.html"><em>feedback edge set</em></a>.
</p>

<p>Author: <a href="../Other/contrib.html#authorPEB">PEB</a></p>
<h2>Implementation</h2>
Steven Skiena's Stony Brook Algorithm Repository <a href="https://algorist.com/problems/Feedback_Edge_Vertex_Set.html" target="_blank">(C)</a>

<hr>

Go to the
<a href="https://www.nist.gov/dads/">Dictionary of Algorithms and Data
Structures</a> home page.

<hr>

